        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant
Efficiency: 0.82. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Axpo (2008);
UUID: 9c67c892-d289-3a7d-bf72-cbfd7d0b3484
This dataset includes the average electricity production of run-of-river power stations in Europe.  2% of the electricity is produced in run-of-river power stations with a reservoir, the rest in power stations without reservoir.
Location: Average electricity production of European run-of-river hydropower plants. GHG emissions valid for temperate zones.
Technology: Mix of run-of-river hydropower plants built between 1945 and 1980, representative for Europe. Efficiency: 0.82. Annual production volume: 38.5GWh/a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9c67c892-d289-3a7d-bf72-cbfd7d0b3484.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
